@CRM_System.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5283

### Health Check
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login as Administrator
POST {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@crm.edu",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### Get Current Authenticated User
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Get All Students (Admin)
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/students?searchTerm=&sortBy=FullName
Accept: application/json

### Get Student by ID
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json
